5,1,1,talk,Rin,,"I need to know how long the morning setup takes. My gaps between meetings are tiny, and I can't lose more time to plugging in.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Toshio,,"I want to see the floor billing basis. The budget hasn't grown, but the team has. I need to know the true monthly cost before we move anything.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Mizuki,,"I’m looking at the drawn plan against the staff survey. We need to know who gets the window and who gets the wall, and why.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Shion,,I’ll check the sound meter readings. The noise level at my desk matters more than the view. I need to know where it’s quiet.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Yumi,,"I want to see what the new joiners reported. I need to know how much we actually talk to each other right now, and what we’re missing.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Rin,,"@Toshio, if the billing is high, maybe we should just stay put? But I really need to know the time cost first.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Rin, staying put isn't an option if the cost is wrong. But I agree, time is a cost too. Let's see the numbers.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Mizuki,,"@Shion, sound is important, but if the plan is unfair, the noise doesn't matter. We need to fix the allocation first.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Shion,,"@Mizuki, fairness is abstract. Pain is real. If my neck hurts, I can't work. I need the data on the quiet spots.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Yumi,,"@Mizuki, I agree. But if we don't talk, we fail. I need to know if the current layout is killing our communication.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Rin,,I’ll check the morning routine on the pilot floor and the arrival times in the badge records. I need to see the real daily flow.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Toshio,,I will examine the basis of the department's floor billing and the facilities quote for re-running power and network. I need the full financial picture.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Mizuki,,I’ll check the drawn plan against the staff survey and the unplanned seat shuffles in the past year. I need to see the history of our mistakes.,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Shion,,I will examine the sound meter readings across the room and the physio's note from the workstation check. I need to optimize my physical comfort.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Yumi,,I’ll check what this year's two joiners reported and the two project strands within earshot last spring. I need to understand our social dynamics.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
