35,2,1,talk,Rin,,The pilot floor takes up to nine minutes to set up! And badge records show half of us arrive after ten. That’s a disaster for my schedule.,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Toshio,,"The billing is for area, not heads. We paid 41,000 yen last month for two empty desks. And re-running power costs 6,200 yen per desk.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Mizuki,,"The plan gives four desks windows, but three are on the wall. The survey says daylight is the top complaint. We’ve been ignoring this.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Shion,,The printer row is nine decibels louder. And the physio says chairs take days to adjust. I need a spot that’s quiet and stable.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Yumi,,"The joiners learned by overhearing. Last spring, when strands were close, we stopped writing notes. We talk more when we’re near.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Rin,,"@Toshio, 6,200 yen per desk is steep. If we move often, we’ll go broke. I need a layout that doesn’t change.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Rin, exactly. We can’t afford to shuffle. We need a fixed layout that minimizes future re-runs.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Mizuki,,"@Shion, if the printer row is loud, we should move it. But who gets the window? That’s the real fight.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Shion,,"@Mizuki, I don’t care about the window. I care about the noise. If I can’t hear myself think, I’m useless.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Yumi,,"@Mizuki, if we group by function, we might isolate people. I want us close enough to talk, but not so close we’re distracted.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Rin,,"@Yumi, if we’re too close, I can’t focus. I need a quiet zone. But I also need to be able to find people quickly.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Toshio,,"@Rin, a fixed layout solves the cost issue. But we need to make sure it’s fair. We can’t just give the best spots to the loudest.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Mizuki,,"@Toshio, I agree. We need a system that’s fair and stable. Rotating blocks might be too chaotic.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Shion,,"@Mizuki, rotating blocks mean I have to re-adjust my chair every month. That’s unacceptable. I need a permanent spot.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Yumi,,"@Shion, I get it. But if everyone is fixed, we might stop talking. I need a balance between stability and connection.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Rin,,"I’m leaning towards fixed desks, but I need to know where the quiet spots are.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Toshio,,I support fixed desks. The cost of moving is too high. We need to lock in the layout.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Mizuki,,"I’m worried about fairness. If we fix the desks, we need to make sure the allocation is just.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Shion,,"I need a quiet, stable desk. I don’t care about the view, just the silence.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Yumi,,"I want us to be close enough to talk, but not so close we’re distracted. Fixed desks by function might work.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
