60,3,1,talk,Rin,,"Option C, Fixed Desks by Function, seems best. It’s stable, so no re-running costs. But I need to know where the quiet spots are.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,1,talk,Toshio,,Option C is the only one that makes financial sense. Re-running power for A or B would bankrupt us.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,1,talk,Mizuki,,"Option C is risky. If we group by function, we might isolate people. But it’s better than the chaos of A.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,1,talk,Shion,,Option C is perfect for me. I can pick a quiet spot and stay there. No more re-adjusting my chair.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,1,talk,Yumi,,"Option C might isolate us. But if we group by function, we might talk more within our groups. I’m hesitant.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,2,talk,Rin,,"@Yumi, if we group by function, we might still talk. I just need a quiet desk. Option C gives me that.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Rin, exactly. Stability is key. We can’t afford the disruption of A or B.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,2,talk,Mizuki,,"@Toshio, I agree on the cost. But we need to ensure the allocation is fair. Who gets the window?","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,2,talk,Shion,,"@Mizuki, I don’t care about the window. I care about the noise. Option C lets me pick a quiet spot.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,2,talk,Yumi,,"@Mizuki, I’m worried about isolation. But if we’re close enough, we might still talk. I’ll vote for C, but I’m nervous.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,3,3,talk,Rin,,I’m voting for C. It’s stable and quiet. I can focus.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,3,3,talk,Toshio,,I’m voting for C. It’s the only option that makes financial sense.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,3,3,talk,Mizuki,,"I’m voting for C. It’s better than the chaos of A, and I hope the allocation is fair.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,3,3,talk,Shion,,I’m voting for C. It’s quiet and stable. I can work.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,3,3,talk,Yumi,,I’m voting for C. I hope we still talk. But it’s the best option for stability.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
